-- src:1926 | (D) the household shall not receive an allotment from the State agency for the period during which the member continues to participate in the work supplementation or support program.
@ref s 2025(b)(3)(D) the household shall not receive an allotment (src:1926)
GIVEN `the procedure applies` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the member continues to participate in the work supplementation or support program` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(b)(3)(D) the household may receive an allotment from the State agency for the period` MEANS
