            -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the household shall not receive an allotment from the State agency for the period during which the member continues to participate"
            IF `the member continues to participate in the work supplementation or support program` THEN JUST FALSE
            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the bar lasts only "for the period during which the member continues to participate"
            OTHERWISE NOTHING
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the bar is part of the procedure that applies only where the State agency elects and identifies the household
